{"updated_at": {"date": {"d": "08", "m": "09", "Y": "2026"}, "time": {"H": "23", "M": "44", "S": "03"}}, "news": [{"title": "Calcutta high court upholds conviction of developer for unauthorised construction", "para": "The Calcutta High Court has upheld the jail sentence of a developer found guilty of illegal construction, affirming that unlawful buildings in Kolkata endanger public safety. The court dismissed an appeal from both the developer and landowner, maintaining the initial three-year imprisonment assessed by the trial court while also adjusting the sentences accordingly.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/regulatory/calcutta-high-court-upholds-conviction-of-developer-for-unauthorised-construction/133939630?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-179168/133939630.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "regulatory"}, {"title": "SC rejects proposal of Parsvnath Developers for homebuyers, asked it to file another", "para": "The Supreme Court turned down Parsvnath Developers' request regarding flat possession and repayment. The court cautioned that a High-Powered Committee could be appointed if the builders don't offer an acceptable proposal. Additionally, a plea from the Insolvency Resolution Professional to access a frozen bank account was denied. The bench emphasized the ongoing struggles faced by homebuyers, linking them to numerous cases involving delayed possessions against the builder.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/regulatory/sc-rejects-proposal-of-parsvnath-developers-for-homebuyers-asked-it-to-file-another/133938857?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-150832/133938857.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "regulatory"}, {"title": "House of Hiranandani leases 2.7 lakh sq ft of office space to Accenture in Mumbai region", "para": "In a notable real estate transaction, House of Hiranandani has successfully leased out 2.72 lakh sq ft of office space located in Thane to Accenture Solutions. The agreement stipulates a monthly rental of Rs 1.9 crore, lasting for ten years. This significant deal underscores the growing demand in the commercial rental market, and JLL India played a key role in facilitating the arrangement.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/commercial/house-of-hiranandani-leases-2-7-lakh-sq-ft-of-office-space-to-accenture-in-mumbai-region/133938796?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-77082/133938796.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "commercial"}]}